WEBVTT

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.400
Found you!

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:20.450
I'm impressed you found such a small yokai.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.260
I'm good at hide-and-seek.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.300
Come play with me! Okay?

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.250
<i>Chow time!</i>

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.520
Oh, little one?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:43.640
Aw, don't go to sleep. I'll eat you.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.700
I'm too worried to leave her here.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:24.660
<b>Mystery 4 "The Mortar"</b>

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.660
Over here!

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.860
Yahiko!

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.320
Yahiko!

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:28.020
Over here!

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.630
You caught me!

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:38.510
Kinako has grown quite fond of you, Yahiko.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.920
Play more!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:42.340
Play with me more, Yahiko!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.580
What? I don't want to.

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:48.340
I'll play after I have a snack, though!

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:57.320
Okina, you can have one.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.350
I'll take the white one, then.

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:01.140
Okay.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.660
Kinako?

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:07.690
Ah, I see.

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:11.020
This is her first time seeing 
you in your other form.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.390
Is it?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.280
By the way, why did you name her Kinako?

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:19.320
Because she looks like the kinako 
mochi I had the other day.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:24.080
You're really Yahiko?

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.600
Of course I am.

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:31.590
See?

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:34.420
Yahiko...

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:39.610
Amazing, Yahiko! I wanna do that, too!

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:40.940
Why don't you, then?

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.640
I wanna transform!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.440
Hey, Kinako.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.220
What, Okina?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.120
Do you feel like going to the Underworld yet?

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.300
No! Not yet!

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:01.760
I'll play hide-and-seek with Yahiko more!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.440
I'll play tag with Yahiko more!

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:09.760
Yahiko, perhaps you were 
too doting toward Kinako.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:12.800
I'm just playing like I always do.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.510
I wasn't trying to dote.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:21.000
<i>We won't be able to play 
together once she's exorcised.</i>

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.780
<i>We'll play a little more,</i>

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.620
<i>and then get Haruitsuki to...</i>

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:34.390
I... I did it, Yahiko.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.940
You got just the ears.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:42.040
You didn't do anything. You're so bad at this.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:46.820
You should start by transforming into 
something simpler, like this rock.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.960
Why can't you do it?

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.100
I can!

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.110
Why?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:02.740
When you're side by side, 
you almost look like siblings.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:06.460
I suppose you're the older brother 
and Kinako's your little sister.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.360
I'm a little sister! Yahiko's little sister!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.520
<i>Siblings...</i>

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:18.630
Oh, all right, then.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.690
Want me to teach you how to transform?

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:25.370
Why don't I give you rakugan 
if you successfully transform?

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.670
Kinako?

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:38.890
Yahiko...

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.220
Yahiko...

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.990
Yahiko...

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.440
Kinako!

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.380
Don't disappear!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.860
Yahiko...

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.370
Yahiko...

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:08.220
I tried to take her to the Mononokean.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:16.740
Is she disappearing?

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.770
Yeah.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.900
Hey, Kinako...

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.520
You'll get better if you 
go to the Underworld.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:29.260
But Haruitsuki can't touch you, either.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.770
We can't carry you there.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:38.210
So... can you walk there by yourself?

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:40.300
Hey, Kinako...

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.480
Hey!

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.780
<i>She can't seem to walk on her own.</i>

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.650
<i>How are we supposed to exorcise her?</i>

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.760
<i>Is she just going to disapp—</i>

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.210
I'm hungry.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.020
Yahiko, Okina-dono, explain to me what—

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.390
Did someone just say "I'm hungry"?

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:02.990
I'm sure I heard a sort of girly voice.

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.480
I heard it pretty clearly.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:05.650
It wasn't my imagination!

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.300
I'm hungry.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:07.770
See? Again!

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:14.010
Haruitsuki, Kinako's saying, 
"I'm hungry. I want some leaves."

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:14.840
Let her eat, then.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:15.780
Okay!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:35.780
Yahiko, another one, please.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.580
Kinako-chan, there's another leaf here.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:44.060
Looks like we've evaded danger for now.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.610
She must have spent all her 
energy at once transforming.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:51.150
I thought she was done for.

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:54.820
Yahiko! More, please!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.120
Yahiko?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.330
Exorcise her.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:12.930
No. I want to play with Yahiko more.

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:16.920
What? Play with me?

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.690
You nearly disappeared.

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:26.620
Someone that weak can't play here with me.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.950
I can.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.570
I feel better when I eat leaves.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.070
Just go to the Underworld.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.010
No.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:39.480
You're not strong enough to 
play in the mundane world!

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:39.950
No!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.370
Are you okay?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.060
Yahiko, don't be so rough with her.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:51.510
Kinako-dono.

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:55.760
To be perfectly clear, if you stay 
in the mundane world any longer,

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.790
you will disappear sooner rather than later.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.330
Let me send you to the Underworld.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:09.900
No!

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:14.680
Kinako-chan, please go to the Underworld.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.760
You might disappear.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.560
I don't want to go alone.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:23.370
I'll go if Yahiko goes, too.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.420
Come to the Underworld with me.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:27.620
Me, too?

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:28.680
Yeah!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:31.950
No.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.670
Let's go, Yahiko.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.980
I can play with you in the 
Underworld without any trouble.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:39.040
I don't want to.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.420
Why not? Let's go, Yahiko.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:42.200
I'm not going.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.500
Yahiko, Yahiko!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.790
Enough already!

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.750
Kinako, that's enough.

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.520
If you won't come with me,

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:52.320
I'm never going to the Underworld!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.560
Yahiko!

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:59.570
I wish that I could go there, too!

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:07.180
But I can't.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.400
That's why I'm here.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.800
Why can't you go to the Underworld?

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:18.180
Why, Yahiko?

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:21.980
Because...

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.600
of Haruitsuki!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:29.240
He's making me help around 
the temple as punishment!

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:31.400
That's why I have to stay here!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.930
<i>He redirected her attention 
toward Abeno-san!</i>

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:34.980
Haruitsuki!

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.990
I'll go to the Underworld with Yahiko.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.790
Tell Yahiko he can go.

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:48.490
No. I won't let Yahiko go.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.000
What?

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:53.820
Don't you think it's about 
time you forgave Yahiko?

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:54.980
No talking.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.430
Go to the Underworld on your own.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.720
No! I want to go with you!

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:11.220
Kinako, if you keep being stubborn, 
I won't like you anymore.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:12.430
Yahiko!

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:13.300
Ashiya.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.410
That's even worse.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.680
I'll go to the Underworld alone, then.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:34.440
Okina-dono, I need to borrow your yard.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.780
Go ahead.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:42.010
<i>Like Okina said, I got 
too involved with Kinako.</i>

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:45.910
<i>If I'd told Haruitsuki sooner,</i>

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:50.980
<i>maybe she wouldn't have nearly 
disappeared or been so willful.</i>

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:56.080
<i>I should've had her exorcised 
before this became so fun.</i>

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:56.980
Huh?

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:06.580
Um, can I talk now?

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.810
Don't say anything you shouldn't.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:12.420
Uh, um...

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:15.210
Let's exorcise her tomorrow.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:20.090
My legs! My legs are tingling...

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:19.280
Kinako, Ashiya is a bad guy.

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.920
You shouldn't listen to him.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.510
I shouldn't have said anything...

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:25.850
Ashiya-dono.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.750
When you consider Kinako's health,

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:35.960
wouldn't you feel more at ease if we 
exorcised her as soon as possible?

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.650
But the ones who will feel better

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:44.950
are us, and not Kinako-chan, right?

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:47.660
And?

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.960
I think we should exorcise 
her as soon as possible, too.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:52.940
But...

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.320
To Kinako-chan, it seems like Yahiko

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.860
is more important to her 
than her own body, right?

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:06.220
But Yahiko can't go, 
so he can't do what she wants.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.210
So here's my compromise.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.390
Yahiko, since you can't go with her,

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:17.930
why don't you play with her a little 
longer to make up for it?

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:30.620
<i>Waiting until tomorrow won't change 
the fact that she doesn't want to go.</i>

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:34.040
<i>When you consider her health, 
she should be exorcised immediately.</i>

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:37.320
<i>And I have another job to do tomorrow.</i>

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:40.040
<i>I'll have to open two portals in one day.</i>

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.710
<i>Though I guess that doesn't matter.</i>

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.710
You look scary...

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.180
<i>Do we have to do it tomorrow?</i>

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:51.230
I won't be selfish or stubborn anymore.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.740
I'll even go to the Underworld alone.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.180
Haruitsuki...

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:01.980
Please say it's okay to play until tomorrow!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:11.560
Ashiya and hairball, I'll 
handle tomorrow's job myself.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:13.450
Accompany Kinako-dono until I return.

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:15.620
And that's okay?

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.570
It's not okay at all,

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:22.170
but if it's just until tomorrow, then fine.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.050
<i>He reluctantly compromised!</i>

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:27.950
Yahiko, Haruitsuki said it's okay!

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:31.000
Let's play a little more, Yahiko!

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:33.180
<i>Why?</i>

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:37.080
<i>Why does she seem so happy?</i>

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.020
All right, fine.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:45.130
We can play just a little longer.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:50.080
Hey, Zenko.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.280
When will it be my turn to be brushed?

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:56.030
You keep brushing Kinako.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:57.450
Just a little longer.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:02.820
Brush me more, Zenko.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:08.140
I don't want to be brushed today after all.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:09.590
Are you sure? I'll brush you.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.340
Not today.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:25.770
Good morning.

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:29.280
You seem to be doing fine, Kinako-dono.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.520
Yeah, I'm fine!

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:32.910
I ate lots of leaves.

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:36.220
Haruitsuki...

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:39.960
Thanks for exorcising me today.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.460
Sure.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:46.760
Yahiko, let's play!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.880
Okay.

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:52.260
I'll set your rakugan down.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:55.240
It looks like doing as Ashiya-dono said

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:59.030
was the right choice, Abeno-dono.

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.020
Everyone's already here.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.470
I'll be back this evening.

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.590
Okay.

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:11.440
Zenko and I can come a little earlier.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.960
Fuzzy, have fun playing with them.

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:22.620
There's not much time left.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:25.850
Let's play, Yahiko.

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:27.990
Okay.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:34.020
<i>While we're still able, we 
should play as much as we can.</i>

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:40.270
<i>After tomorrow, I won't be able</i>

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:44.640
<i>to play with Kinako anymore.</i>

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:54.500
Haruitsuki is here.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:02.420
<i>He's already here.</i>

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:08.250
<i>Kinako's leaving for the Underworld already.</i>

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.180
Yahiko...

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.250
Bye-bye.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:27.210
<i>Why am I thinking that
I don't want her to go now?</i>

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:31.220
<i>I'm the one who told her not to be willful.</i>

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.940
<i>I can't say I don't want her to go.</i>

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.250
Exorcise her already.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:47.620
Kinako-dono, are you ready to be exorcised?

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:51.530
Yes, I'm ready.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:58.520
Master of the Mononokean, Abeno Haruitsuki,

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:00.890
requesting a portal to the Underworld.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:06.810
Yahiko, come closer.

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:09.000
I'm fine here.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:09.980
But...

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:11.850
Don't be that way.

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:13.530
No!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:15.050
I hate you, Ashiya!

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:16.390
Yeah, yeah.

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:18.680
Kinako-dono.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:24.040
If you're feeling anxious, would you 
like me to accompany you partway there?

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:26.810
No. I can go by myself.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:29.340
I won't be willful anymore.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.930
Yahiko, bye-bye.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.400
Bye-bye.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.280
Kinako-chan, wait!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.900
Don't push me, Ashi—

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:12.170
I don't like the way you're acting.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:18.490
She said goodbye three times, 
and you haven't responded once.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.180
Is this what you want?

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.100
Yahiko...

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:33.980
No.

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.130
<i>Don't go.</i>

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:42.240
<i>I still want to play together more.</i>

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.490
<i>I want you to be here tomorrow.</i>

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.990
<i>I don't want you to leave.</i>

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.740
<i>But I'd hate it more if you disappeared.</i>

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.620
<i>So even though I don't want to say it...</i>

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.870
Bye-bye.

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:07.510
Become stronger so you don't 
disappear anymore, Kinako.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.020
I will! I'll get stronger!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.730
Strong enough to transform like you!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.920
I'll get lots stronger!

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:18.620
Okay.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:40.170
<i>I wanted to spend more time together, 
but instead of disappearing here,</i>

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:45.110
<i>even if it means never seeing her again, 
I'd rather have her be well over there.</i>

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.640
Bye-bye, Kinako.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.700
Kinako-chan...

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:01.750
She's gone.

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:03.160
Yeah.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.770
Hey, Yahiko.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:14.170
I'm, well... sorry I was a little harsh earlier.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:20.620
Yahiko hates me even more now.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:21.880
My, my.

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:25.150
Haruitsuki...

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:26.260
What?

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:31.770
I thought Ashiya was useless,

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:33.990
but he might not be.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.740
I don't hate him that much.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:37.650
I'll get him some dumplings later.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.850
You should be telling him that.

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.300
No way.

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:53.320
I'm so tired.

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:54.570
Abeno-san?!

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time: "The Tiger"</b>

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:28.210
Fuzzy was arrested and 
taken to the Underworld?

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:30.380
There must be some mistake!

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:32.890
You just wait, Fuzzy! I'll save you!

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.600
Next time, "The Tiger."

00:23:34.600 --> 00:23:38.060
Y-You're the Executive?
